PTorder   0   (Max Perturbation order)
KinOrder  10  (Max order in the kinetic energy expansion)
PotOrder  10  (Max order in the potential energy expansion)

Natoms 4      (Number of atoms)
Nmodes 6      (Number of modes = 3*Natoms-6)

(C2H2 6D singular_3D calculation with new CCSD(T)/CBS(aug-TZ,aug-QZ) POTEN_C2H2_MORSE_COSALPHA_COSNTAU-SIN-SIN PES)

PRIMITIVES
  Npolyads      12      (how many polyads we calculate)
  enercut    40000.0   (energy cut in the primitive matrix for the diagonalization)
END

CONTRACTION
  Npolyads        12
  enercut       24000.0
  coeff_thresh  1.0e-14
  degeneracy    1e-2
  sample_points  8
  sample_attempts 50
  symm_toler      1e-3
END

SYMGROUP   D2h(M)

DIAGONALIZER
  SYEVD
  enermax 16000.0
end

verbose 4

dstep 0.005    (finite difference element for each mode )

COORDS     local
frame      BC-Z-CD-X
TRANSFORM  r1-r2-r3-rho1-rho2-tau-abs
MOLTYPE    abcd
REFER-CONF non-RIGID  (Reference configuarion: RIGID or NON-RIGID)
